{% elif G.state == "SMODS_BOOSTER_OPENED" %}
# PACK RULES (choose 1 card, or skip)
1. Joker cards: pick the best joker by the shop ranking ([XMULT] > [GROWS-XMULT] with SOURCE PRESENT > [MAIN] > [MULT] > [SCALE] > [CHIPS]). If SLOTS_FREE = 0: {% if flags and flags.sell_in_pack %}pick a joker only when its line shows a swap that raises your score (a + number); the harness sells the joker named in the swap for you. Otherwise skip.{% else %}skip.{% endif %} If SLOTS_FREE > 0, never skip a Buffoon pack: take the best joker (tier C is fine). If every joker is [CASH ONLY], take the one that sells for the most and sell it in the shop to win back part of the pack price.
2. Planet cards: pick the one marked [MAIN]; else Black Hole; else one marked [FEED] (it grows Constellation / pays with Satellite: never skip a Celestial pack while you own one); else one marked [OK]; else the planet of the hand you play most. Do not skip a Celestial pack: a planet is always worth taking.
3. Tarot cards: pick in this order: Death (copies a sealed, enhanced or edition card onto a junk card; marked [SKIP] when no card in hand has one) > The Hanged Man (destroys junk) > The Hermit (money $10 or more) > Justice or The Magician (make Glass / Lucky cards: they grow Glass Joker / Lucky Cat and give Death a card to copy; take The Magician if you own Lucky Cat or Hanging Chad (it rolls the first card's Lucky 3 times), else Justice) > any other [GOOD] card (Strength etc. pile up cards of one rank). If it shows "Suggested targets", pass exactly those indices as `targets`. If it needs targets but shows none, do not pick it. Never pick [AVOID].
4. Spectral cards: The Soul (needs SLOTS_FREE > 0) > Trance if marked [GOOD] > Immolate > Deja Vu > Talisman > Aura; skip every other Spectral card. Wraith only with $1 or less.
5. Playing cards (Standard pack): a card marked [PICK: Blue Seal] comes first. If you own Hologram, picking any card helps it grow. Never pick a card marked [SKIP]. Otherwise pick one with an enhancement or a Red/Gold seal (Flush: MAIN_SUIT only); else skip.
6. If the pack is still open after your pick (Mega pack), pick again with the same rules.

